{"text":"大魏永熙二年歲次癸丑，三月一日，清信士佛弟子劉景和爲亡父母敬造釋迦像一區在窟。願亡父母託生天上安樂之處，值遇諸佛。造像以後，願因緣眷屬有形之類皆得成佛。訖。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"劉景和","refId":null,"text":"劉景和","start":22,"end":25},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"釋迦","start":31,"end":33},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"託生","refId":null,"text":"託生","start":43,"end":45},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"天上","refId":null,"text":"天上","start":45,"end":47},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"安樂","refId":null,"text":"安樂","start":47,"end":49},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"因緣","refId":null,"text":"因緣","start":63,"end":65},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"有形","start":67,"end":69}]}